WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.374 --> 00:00:03.591
Unit twenty-four. Healthy Families!

2
00:00:04.541 --> 00:00:08.190
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:11.506
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.556 --> 00:00:15.220
Today we learn about Healthy Families. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.175 --> 00:00:19.691
Family. Say it with me. Family!

6
00:00:23.202 --> 00:00:26.619
Support. Say it with me. Support!

7
00:00:30.128 --> 00:00:33.428
Meal. Say it with me. Meal!

8
00:00:36.926 --> 00:00:40.126
Talk. Say it with me. Talk!

9
00:00:43.626 --> 00:00:47.076
Chores. Say it with me. Chores!

10
00:00:50.587 --> 00:00:54.220
Respect. Say it with me. Respect!

11
00:00:57.709 --> 00:01:01.159
Love. Say it with me. Love!

12
00:01:04.642 --> 00:01:07.592
Time. Say it with me. Time!

13
00:01:11.106 --> 00:01:19.240
A healthy family gives support and love. We share a meal, talk about our day, and help with chores. We show respect and spend time together.

14
00:01:19.290 --> 00:01:20.460
I can do that too!

15
00:01:21.734 --> 00:01:26.960
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:27.010 --> 00:01:28.160
Meal!

17
00:01:29.019 --> 00:01:34.219
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:34.269 --> 00:01:35.419
Love!

19
00:01:36.247 --> 00:01:42.936
Did you know? Eating meals together can help families feel closer and eat more healthily!

20
00:01:42.986 --> 00:01:45.067
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:45.746 --> 00:01:53.614
Think and answer. What does your family enjoy doing together?

22
00:01:53.664 --> 00:01:54.814
Great answer!

23
00:01:56.179 --> 00:02:01.032
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:01.082 --> 00:02:03.784
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

